# MiGuOrca frontend (Stage 27, US-197)
#
# - node_modules and build output are NOT committed. CI runs `npm ci` then
#   rebuilds from source (see `.github/workflows/ci.yml`), so the lockfile is
#   the source of truth, never `dist/`.
# - Keep `dist/` out of the repo: Flask serves the production build from
#   `frontend/dist/`, which deployments build at release time.
node_modules/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Local editor/OS noise
.DS_Store
*.local
